#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:1
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_000/text"
msgstr "[color=#696969][i]※当前位置  露园※[/i][/color]"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:4
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_002/text"
msgstr "露园有八百年的历史，说是海临王修的。门票四块钱，我摸了摸口袋，还是进去了。"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:7
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_004/text"
msgstr "左边的花圃里开着一朵白玉菊花，我摘了下来。"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:11
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_006/text"
msgstr "继续往里走，路越收越窄，我听见自己的脚步声在墙上弹回来。"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:14
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_008/text"
msgstr "迷宫中央立着一个人影。"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:16
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_009/text"
msgstr "那是个穿着华服的女人，被一根棍子立在地上，眼皮被细线缝在眉毛上，手背上画着符咒。"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:19
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_011/text"
msgstr "我不敢再看，转身就跑，出了露园。"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:24
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_016/text"
msgstr "我抬手把她头上的绣球花摘了下来。她的眼皮轻轻抖了一下。"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:29
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_019/text"
msgstr "我飞快地跑出露园。"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:34
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_026/text"
msgstr "中间的矮墙上爬着一株绿色兰花，我摘了下来。"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:38
msgid "Text/lj_06_luyuan_028/text"
msgstr "继续往里走，路越收越窄，我听见自己的脚步声在墙上弹回来。"

#: res://timelines/06_luyuan.dtl:41
